From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:33:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] media: show rocknix gamelist art where es-de has none

With LegacyGamelistFileLocation on, the ROCKNIX media paths of each entry (image, thumbnail, marquee, wheel, video, fanart, titleshot, boxback, manual) are kept from the gamelist. The gamelist and system views, the media viewer, the PDF viewer and the launch screen show that file when ES-DE has no media of the type and the file is inside the system folder. The scraper and media removal still use the ES-DE media directory only.
